ion><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">هو الطعان العياب<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/521</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والهمز: أشد؛ لأن الهمز الدفع بشدة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/521</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وإنما ذم من يكثر الهمز.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/521</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s104a1\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/id/ayah/104-2.html\">Ayat berikutnya (104:2)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/104-2.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Humaza 104:2 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"yang mengumpulkan harta dan menghitung-hitungnya,924)\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/104-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/104-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/104-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/104-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/104-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/104-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirsh